            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nThis indeed was the case because those mappings were cached once after picker started and not updated with `set_picker_opts()`. This use case also showed some minor issue with `set_picker_items()` (which is used by `set_picker_items_from_cli()`) about not properly updating actually shown items. Should be fixed now.\r\n\r\nThe code snippet from the issue should now work after a reasonable tweaking:\r\n- Fix typo in `func = M.pik_dirs_action,` -> `func = M.pick_dirs_action,`\r\n- Unset `scroll_down` built-in action which is `<C-f>` by default. For this, add `scroll_down = ''` in initial `config.mappings`. Or better yet, use some other not used or less significant key (like `<C-d>` or `<C-t>`, for example).",
