            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Before the issue is closed, another small question. I'm having troubles opening mini.files from mini.pick. When I add to my previous code snippet \r\n```\r\n...\r\nsource = {\r\n    choose = function(item)\r\n        MiniFiles.open(MiniPick.get_picker_opts().source.cwd .. '/' .. item, false)\r\n    end,\r\n},\r\n...\r\n```\r\nin table inside `M.pick_dirs_action`, choosing the directory opens file explorer but then closes it after 1 second. I assume it's because of how picker is closed. Is there some workaround?",
